<title>POLAND: Elektrim signs PLN 50 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Elektrim signs PLN 50 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish industrial and trading conglomerate Elektrim said on Thursday it had signed a 49.8-million-zloty contract to build facilities at the Polish power plant Elektrownia Turow.</p>
<p>Elektrim said in a statement the work on a new limestone grinding facility would be carried out by January 30, 1998. It gave no further details and company officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
